stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Transient: new Ticket()
  Transient --> Managed: persist() / save() of new entity
  Managed --> Managed: setters change fields (dirty checking at flush)
  Managed --> Detached: transaction ends, session closed
  Detached --> Managed: merge() returns a managed copy
  Managed --> Removed: remove()
  Removed --> [*]: flush issues DELETE
  Managed --> [*]: flush issues INSERT or UPDATE ... WHERE id=? AND version=?
